Mighty Action Force: The Card Game (Print & Play) is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to Poptropica or its owners.

1. Third-party material: not licensed

   Poptropica, Mighty Action Force, and all related characters, artwork, card art, card text, names, logos, fonts and
   other material from the original game are trademarks and copyright of their respective owners. This includes all
   such material wherever it appears in this project: the extracted assets, the source SVGs, and the generated PDFs
   and images.

   None of that material is licensed by this project, and nothing here grants any rights to it. It is included only
   for non-commercial fan purposes.

2. Everything else

   The rest of this project (the build scripts, page layouts, the turn card and scoreboard designs, the rules booklet
   text and the variant rules) may be freely copied, shared and adapted for non-commercial purposes. No credit is
   needed.

3. No commercial use

   No part of this project, including printed copies and adaptations, may be sold or used for profit.

This project is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.
